menu "SDR link"

    config SDR_LINK_BAUD
        int "UART0 baud rate"
        default 921600
        help
            Must divide the 80 MHz APB clock cleanly and be supported by the
            USB bridge. A classic CP2102 tops out at 921600: a request for
            1000000 is accepted but the chip still runs at 921600.

endmenu
